    <description><![CDATA[## Install

```powershell
choco install whisper-cpp
```

Chocolatey downloads the official Windows build from the [ggml-org/whisper.cpp](https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp/releases) releases and puts it on your PATH.
The archive holds more than twenty executables, including test binaries. Only `whisper-cli` and `whisper-server` are put on your PATH.

## What is whisper.cpp?

Port of OpenAI's Whisper model in C/C++.

Upstream describes it with these topics: inference, openai, speech-recognition, speech-to-text, transformer, whisper.

## Upgrade

```powershell
choco upgrade whisper-cpp
```

## Uninstall

```powershell
choco uninstall whisper-cpp
```

